              </div>
              <div style="--gws-column-tablet-start:3;--gws-column-tablet-end:10;--gws-column-laptop-start:8;--gws-column-laptop-end:11;" class="Grid_column">
                <div class="Template5050Accordion_column">
                  <div class="Template5050Accordion_inner"><gws-accordion-item index="0" current="true" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: Your files, all in one place">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">Your files, all in one place</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body">
                          <p>Edit and organize <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/products/docs/" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/products/docs/" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/products/docs/" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the Google Docs page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">Google Docs</span></a></span>, <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the Sheets page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">Sheets</span></a></span>, <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/products/slides/" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/products/slides/" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/products/slides/" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the Slides page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">Slides</span></a></span>, Microsoft Office files, and PDFs in real-time. Plus, access over 100 other file types! </p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="image" class="AccordionItem_imageContainer AccordionItem_ytContainer">
                        <picture>
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/3sLch4ekxWH37o_wVVS45wGAYXsTpTDGTj2IpdDHBOuusueuQUrZQz7kuCrchXcWFvCiG4xb6mwaS9bHcWbBvAYTsTn6EPWSN0_L=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/3sLch4ekxWH37o_wVVS45wGAYXsTpTDGTj2IpdDHBOuusueuQUrZQz7kuCrchXcWFvCiG4xb6mwaS9bHcWbBvAYTsTn6EPWSN0_L=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)" width="1368" height="1000" type="image/webp" />
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/JW5yBtLe-uKqsPHYeM9-cvXxhJwwu3LXaMdpE0cPhRBufsh7HtfUcv081LuADi9tV5nPM9ThwS2l9u-n69Q7fBT-85T2OYfRm3A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/JW5yBtLe-uKqsPHYeM9-cvXxhJwwu3LXaMdpE0cPhRBufsh7HtfUcv081LuADi9tV5nPM9ThwS2l9u-n69Q7fBT-85T2OYfRm3A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 600px)" width="944" height="600" type="image/webp" /><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YBoOblEOoA2JlansOvhJSIbtFvqdtXQKDGRbgpppCQwuNaZELHNlG7cLyp5rPbM06y5fckquCG5S-QtazQ65SpMsKe7ly2p2Cblq2A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YBoOblEOoA2JlansOvhJSIbtFvqdtXQKDGRbgpppCQwuNaZELHNlG7cLyp5rPbM06y5fckquCG5S-QtazQ65SpMsKe7ly2p2Cblq2A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YBoOblEOoA2JlansOvhJSIbtFvqdtXQKDGRbgpppCQwuNaZELHNlG7cLyp5rPbM06y5fckquCG5S-QtazQ65SpMsKe7ly2p2Cblq2A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" alt="A logo cloud of popular Google Workspace products" width="608" height="500" loading="lazy" />
                        </picture>
                      </div>
                    </gws-accordion-item><gws-accordion-item index="1" current="false" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: Annotate PDFs">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">Annotate PDFs</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body">
                          <p>Add and edit comments directly in the PDFs by highlighting text. </p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="image" class="AccordionItem_imageContainer AccordionItem_ytContainer">
                        <picture>
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ol2xXubqG8OEcW1u_4hx2WtjjV4QGpbhYys5pbHo2iL0r4T9YEUP71bqTG8LLpIaMtRg1aGLhAL3vGybQYSv1xC-LRl-1nxPGR15=e365-pa-nu-rw-w684 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ol2xXubqG8OEcW1u_4hx2WtjjV4QGpbhYys5pbHo2iL0r4T9YEUP71bqTG8LLpIaMtRg1aGLhAL3vGybQYSv1xC-LRl-1nxPGR15=e365-pa-nu-rw-w1368 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)" width="1368" height="1000" type="image/webp" />
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OxLXxY29up7sdPfWF9uj5OwN6QB7GzT3W24dMSRaHm_iG9SbaF5WOvroy8X_Cq6YM5gamIbQlBFdFX1FZb1qGaVQXibW_PW8BUb-0Q=e365-pa-nu-rw-w632 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OxLXxY29up7sdPfWF9uj5OwN6QB7GzT3W24dMSRaHm_iG9SbaF5WOvroy8X_Cq6YM5gamIbQlBFdFX1FZb1qGaVQXibW_PW8BUb-0Q=e365-pa-nu-rw-w944 2x" media="(min-width: 600px)" width="944" height="600" type="image/webp" /><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rL3gTDbebn8ifH9vcQV8ilQNRfVgkqYnd-1x-bhM90Go5vhjzwhG9bN47qfl_8BXdqdhcMlhicsJd-xWv1QSum_hqZBOCviwVPpAVw=e365-pa-nu-rw-w527" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rL3gTDbebn8ifH9vcQV8ilQNRfVgkqYnd-1x-bhM90Go5vhjzwhG9bN47qfl_8BXdqdhcMlhicsJd-xWv1QSum_hqZBOCviwVPpAVw=e365-pa-nu-rw-w527 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rL3gTDbebn8ifH9vcQV8ilQNRfVgkqYnd-1x-bhM90Go5vhjzwhG9bN47qfl_8BXdqdhcMlhicsJd-xWv1QSum_hqZBOCviwVPpAVw=e365-pa-nu-rw-w608 2x" alt="Highlighting text to add a comment to a pdf" width="608" height="500" loading="lazy" />
                        </picture>
                      </div>
                    </gws-accordion-item><gws-accordion-item index="2" current="false" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: AI-powered search">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">AI-powered search</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body">
                          <p>Drive's search, powered by AI, offers speed, and reliability by quickly surfacing relevant results based on your activities. </p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="image" class="AccordionItem_imageContainer AccordionItem_ytContainer">
                        <picture>
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/dFHS6XWZ_kIH8Xk1suewW316HRAhXn9XL4v_5gscX8D479l1gVjx7dZVB9wKIf_wfr3f52Cl5v63A17g0CnCkKRIAZ22Av8MtQEnAw=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/dFHS6XWZ_kIH8Xk1suewW316HRAhXn9XL4v_5gscX8D479l1gVjx7dZVB9wKIf_wfr3f52Cl5v63A17g0CnCkKRIAZ22Av8MtQEnAw=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)" width="1368" height="1000" type="image/webp" />
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/vAqYowfTyYIh62QEguTIg5JUndBDLvuBpaxNnCKi0gPrDFc93QueCKEdUlZC1FJmAwLMienqjF6v-miHASa3mBb1xEdiBXXp6h1i=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/vAqYowfTyYIh62QEguTIg5JUndBDLvuBpaxNnCKi0gPrDFc93QueCKEdUlZC1FJmAwLMienqjF6v-miHASa3mBb1xEdiBXXp6h1i=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 600px)" width="944" height="600" type="image/webp" /><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8IR19g0nVrklRptk-dzIPClrss3FBpvOXVUlGQwSoC_CCQbtGq1qWGwjOkjmK3OhCoFg-L0Z_OjKgtfnmWdhxXUXuH4LmlKopTQ=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8IR19g0nVrklRptk-dzIPClrss3FBpvOXVUlGQwSoC_CCQbtGq1qWGwjOkjmK3OhCoFg-L0Z_OjKgtfnmWdhxXUXuH4LmlKopTQ=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8IR19g0nVrklRptk-dzIPClrss3FBpvOXVUlGQwSoC_CCQbtGq1qWGwjOkjmK3OhCoFg-L0Z_OjKgtfnmWdhxXUXuH4LmlKopTQ=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" alt="Searching Drive and receiving file and folder results
" width="608" height="500" loading="lazy" />
                        </picture>
                      </div>
                    </gws-accordion-item><gws-accordion-item index="3" current="false" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: Activity view">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">Activity view</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body"><gws-tooltip>
                            <div class="Badge_badge Badge_badgeSmall">
                              <picture><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-workspace-assets/uploads/7uffzv9dk4sn-7LhoZoRSU32Sn20yI8213k-92d83d07ba564bddac887d329c3589c2-Vector.svg" alt width="12" height="15" loading="lazy" /></picture><span class="Badge_label">Premium feature</span>
                            </div><gws-popover offset="10" slot="popover" placement="bottom" class="Badge_tooltip">
                              <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_xs">
                                <p>This feature is available on some Google Workspace <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html?source=gafb-drive-body-en&amp;hl=en&amp;ga_region=amer&amp;ga_country=us&amp;ga_lang=en" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the Business and Enterprise page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">Business and Enterprise</span></a></span> plans.</p>
                              </div>
                            </gws-popover>
                          </gws-tooltip>
                          <p>Get a quick overview of your file activity across Workspace in one place, empowering you to act efficiently. </p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="image" class="AccordionItem_imageContainer AccordionItem_ytContainer">
                        <picture>
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2HqYqW5oTUWFEyiynJ2DAam7LFqadPKQ1xIem9q4eSsAX0gPGP2ON99vV4OizBuhYs8A91mF8zmI1Mm_xRRildEvm_VxhPgUdPco=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2HqYqW5oTUWFEyiynJ2DAam7LFqadPKQ1xIem9q4eSsAX0gPGP2ON99vV4OizBuhYs8A91mF8zmI1Mm_xRRildEvm_VxhPgUdPco=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)" width="1368" height="1000" type="image/webp" />
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/CBMEqdZjzA0ErZ2o0frXntFLf-RX1EuWTqenbPLppCwoozR4mmFTv90O-VSJyNl269WR2pTGQn5m4WOi3a3hrq8qGKUrXx5K7nc=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/CBMEqdZjzA0ErZ2o0frXntFLf-RX1EuWTqenbPLppCwoozR4mmFTv90O-VSJyNl269WR2pTGQn5m4WOi3a3hrq8qGKUrXx5K7nc=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 600px)" width="944" height="600" type="image/webp" /><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VYY2it8lUeTqqNR2HWy5sVBFdBOnwGisdPFtEo0xhms4X3KlVM3MZnWeaTmGJBDTzw9T4Sl3bvpEu_kCqa-m35b5fW0CncCFe7A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VYY2it8lUeTqqNR2HWy5sVBFdBOnwGisdPFtEo0xhms4X3KlVM3MZnWeaTmGJBDTzw9T4Sl3bvpEu_kCqa-m35b5fW0CncCFe7A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VYY2it8lUeTqqNR2HWy5sVBFdBOnwGisdPFtEo0xhms4X3KlVM3MZnWeaTmGJBDTzw9T4Sl3bvpEu_kCqa-m35b5fW0CncCFe7A=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" alt="Recent activity list in Drive, including access requests and comments
" width="608" height="500" loading="lazy" />
                        </picture>
                      </div>
                    </gws-accordion-item></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </gws-accordion-5050-container></section>
        <div id="m16" data-module="TemplateSpacer" data-g-section-id="spacer">
          <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:92px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:120px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
        </div>
        <section id="collaborate" data-module="TemplateSectionBreak" data-g-section-id="collaborate">
          <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid TemplateSectionBreak_grid">
            <div style="--gws-column-laptop-start:3;--gws-column-laptop-end:10;" class="Grid_column TemplateSectionBreak_container">
              <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg TemplateSectionBreak_copyGroup">
                <h2 class="Heading_heading heading Heading_size:h3">Streamlined content collaboration and workflows</h2>
                <p>Unleash your team's full potential with seamless collaboration and effortless teamwork. </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <div id="m18" data-module="TemplateSpacer" data-g-section-id="spacer">
          <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:36px;--gws-spacer-tablet-size:36px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:36px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
        </div>
        <section id="m19" data-module="Template5050Accordion" data-g-section-id="5050-accordion"><gws-accordion-5050-container slide-timing="15" current="0">
            <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid Template5050Accordion_container">
              <div style="--gws-column-tablet-start:3;--gws-column-tablet-end:10;--gws-column-laptop-start:2;--gws-column-laptop-end:5;" class="Grid_column">
                <div class="Template5050Accordion_column">
                  <div class="Template5050Accordion_inner"><gws-accordion-item index="0" current="true" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: Manage access">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">Manage access</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body">
                          <p>Easily <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/resources/file-sharing/" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/resources/file-sharing/" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/resources/file-sharing/" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the share files page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">share files</span></a></span> with customizable permissions (edit, comment, view). Control access further by preventing unwanted actions and setting expiration dates.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="image" class="AccordionItem_imageContainer AccordionItem_ytContainer">
                        <picture>
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/hPG3lWaWk3kfq0hOfcARezmwxBTtzuC9N6_mb-M22w6CgZi8Id7RHsOUnua_qBxi8viYjt-oP6_bGvAh0xigAbzAVfneO0QLvSewpw=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/hPG3lWaWk3kfq0hOfcARezmwxBTtzuC9N6_mb-M22w6CgZi8Id7RHsOUnua_qBxi8viYjt-oP6_bGvAh0xigAbzAVfneO0QLvSewpw=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)" width="1368" height="1000" type="image/webp" />
