                    </gws-accordion-item><gws-accordion-item index="2" current="false" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: Electronic signatures">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">Electronic signatures </h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body"><gws-tooltip>
                            <div class="Badge_badge Badge_badgeSmall">
                              <picture><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-workspace-assets/uploads/7uffzv9dk4sn-7LhoZoRSU32Sn20yI8213k-92d83d07ba564bddac887d329c3589c2-Vector.svg" alt width="12" height="15" loading="lazy" /></picture><span class="Badge_label">Premium feature</span>
                            </div><gws-popover offset="10" slot="popover" placement="bottom" class="Badge_tooltip">
                              <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_xs">
                                <p>This feature is available on some Google Workspace <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html?source=gafb-drive-body-en&amp;hl=en&amp;ga_region=amer&amp;ga_country=us&amp;ga_lang=en" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the Business and Enterprise page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">Business and Enterprise</span></a></span> plans.</p>
                              </div>
                            </gws-popover>
                          </gws-tooltip>
                          <p>Request <span class="gws-button"><a href="/resources/esignature/" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="/resources/esignature/" data-g-label="/resources/esignature/" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the electronic signatures page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">electronic signatures</span></a></span> and easily manage vendor agreements, customer contracts, stakeholder sign-off, and more.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="image" class="AccordionItem_imageContainer AccordionItem_ytContainer">
                        <picture>
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ET11yAkZQS4SGms4BUhgKqd3s4rbtZcvpUo8z2OfraBYJEygbOgQxNgE5jUNOWS9YdtCC-S05Jrx6JvGA0_KwVQhQOfufIFov3y7=e365-pa-nu-rw-w684 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ET11yAkZQS4SGms4BUhgKqd3s4rbtZcvpUo8z2OfraBYJEygbOgQxNgE5jUNOWS9YdtCC-S05Jrx6JvGA0_KwVQhQOfufIFov3y7=e365-pa-nu-rw-w1368 2x" media="(min-width: 1024px)" width="1368" height="1000" type="image/webp" />
                          <source srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/AVs6IUsZYFjnmuF-_S_3sDRnlHgTmDYwzlpdxHThZAbajogmZ9dIQpSJCJtrmSKKSoFZ9EVXQzkBF2yybjHnfa_V-NaHx84_N031=e365-pa-nu-rw-w632 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/AVs6IUsZYFjnmuF-_S_3sDRnlHgTmDYwzlpdxHThZAbajogmZ9dIQpSJCJtrmSKKSoFZ9EVXQzkBF2yybjHnfa_V-NaHx84_N031=e365-pa-nu-rw-w944 2x" media="(min-width: 600px)" width="944" height="600" type="image/webp" /><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/DF6Uy_ddqYkZtgQlN830yPFxbomC07ZYOEbVuNrEy5_7Es9NGm2Y4DcqtT1-EbAB7cy83jwXw9cCfkXj1FkTGPIv_wAQq1dAt3Q=e365-pa-nu-rw-w527" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/DF6Uy_ddqYkZtgQlN830yPFxbomC07ZYOEbVuNrEy5_7Es9NGm2Y4DcqtT1-EbAB7cy83jwXw9cCfkXj1FkTGPIv_wAQq1dAt3Q=e365-pa-nu-rw-w527 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/DF6Uy_ddqYkZtgQlN830yPFxbomC07ZYOEbVuNrEy5_7Es9NGm2Y4DcqtT1-EbAB7cy83jwXw9cCfkXj1FkTGPIv_wAQq1dAt3Q=e365-pa-nu-rw-w608 2x" alt="Requesting electronic signatures on a file on Drive" width="608" height="500" loading="lazy" />
                        </picture>
                      </div>
                    </gws-accordion-item><gws-accordion-item index="3" current="false" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-label="/products/drive/" data-g-action="click: 3rd party integrations">
                      <div slot="heading">
                        <h3 style="--text-font-weight:500;" class="Text_container Text_subheading Text_weight AccordionItem_heading">3rd party integrations </h3>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="body">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg AccordionItem_body"><gws-tooltip>
                            <div class="Badge_badge Badge_badgeSmall">
                              <picture><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-workspace-assets/uploads/7uffzv9dk4sn-7LhoZoRSU32Sn20yI8213k-92d83d07ba564bddac887d329c3589c2-Vector.svg" alt width="12" height="15" loading="lazy" /></picture><span class="Badge_label">Premium feature</span>
                            </div><gws-popover offset="10" slot="popover" placement="bottom" class="Badge_tooltip">
                              <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_xs">
                                <p>This feature is available on some Google Workspace <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html?source=gafb-drive-body-en&amp;hl=en&amp;ga_region=amer&amp;ga_country=us&amp;ga_lang=en" data-g-event="drive: body #5050-accordion" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-uj-def="body_5050_accordion" aria-label="Open the Business and Enterprise page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">Business and Enterprise</span></a></span> plans.</p>
                              </div>
                            </gws-popover>
                          </gws-tooltip>
                          <p>Import and create Google Drive files within third party apps like Slack, Zoom, Salesforce, Atlassian, SAP and many more to streamline your work. </p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
