        <section id="customers" data-module="TemplateBackgroundContainer" data-g-section-id="customers">
          <div class="TemplateBackgroundContainer_container">
            <div class="TemplateBackgroundContainer_wrapper TemplateBackgroundContainer_grey">
              <div class="TemplateBackgroundContainer_modules">
                <div id="m33-1" data-module="TemplateSpacer">
                  <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:60px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:80px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
                </div>
                <section id="m33-2" data-module="TemplateSectionBreak">
                  <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid TemplateSectionBreak_grid">
                    <div style="--gws-column-laptop-start:3;--gws-column-laptop-end:10;" class="Grid_column TemplateSectionBreak_container">
                      <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg TemplateSectionBreak_copyGroup">
                        <h2 class="Heading_heading heading Heading_size:h3">Learn why organizations use Drive</h2>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </section>
                <div id="m33-3" data-module="TemplateSpacer">
                  <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:36px;--gws-spacer-tablet-size:36px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:36px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
                </div>
                <section id="m33-4" data-module="TemplateQuoteCarousel">
                  <div style="--gws-container-max-width:100%;" class="Container_layout Container_maxWidth TemplateQuoteCarousel_container Container_flush"><gws-carousel remember-position>
                      <div slot="slides">
                        <div class="QuoteSlide_container">
                          <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid QuoteSlide_grid">
                            <div style="--gws-column-desktop-start:2;--gws-column-desktop-end:11;" class="Grid_column QuoteSlide_gridCol">
                              <div class="QuoteSlide_logo">
                                <div class="LogoArea_container logo-area">
                                  <picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/T_tLbRCbzM7ifjUXCsdNT-7uKCqX1ExJgRAXAPPoDlg8rILLXXvWWREpvmJyk6lZ61qlKmh3YrhfrGhcqPhdc5ce5fCTqoXA1i2z=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/T_tLbRCbzM7ifjUXCsdNT-7uKCqX1ExJgRAXAPPoDlg8rILLXXvWWREpvmJyk6lZ61qlKmh3YrhfrGhcqPhdc5ce5fCTqoXA1i2z=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/T_tLbRCbzM7ifjUXCsdNT-7uKCqX1ExJgRAXAPPoDlg8rILLXXvWWREpvmJyk6lZ61qlKmh3YrhfrGhcqPhdc5ce5fCTqoXA1i2z=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" alt="Blue Ox Films logo" width="225" height="225" loading="lazy" /></picture>
                                </div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="QuoteSlide_body">
                                <figure class="QuoteSlide_figure">
                                  <blockquote class="blockquote--add-quotes">
                                    <p>We’ve automated our kick-off process. When we have a new project come in, within two minutes, we have all of the relevant templates duplicated in a Google Drive folder.</p>
                                  </blockquote>
                                  <figcaption class="QuoteSlide_figcaption"><strong>Taylor Kavanaugh</strong>, Co-founder and Executive Producer, Blue Ox Films</figcaption><span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/customers/blueoxfilms/ " data-g-event="drive: customers #quote-carousel" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/customers/blueoxfilms/" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/customers/blueoxfilms/ " data-uj-def="customers_quote_carousel" aria-label="Learn more about the Blue Ox Films customer story" class="button button--medium"><span class="button__content">Learn more</span></a></span>
                                </figure>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="slides">
                        <div class="QuoteSlide_container">
                          <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid QuoteSlide_grid">
                            <div style="--gws-column-desktop-start:2;--gws-column-desktop-end:11;" class="Grid_column QuoteSlide_gridCol">
                              <div class="QuoteSlide_logo">
                                <div class="LogoArea_container logo-area">
                                  <picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/I8_eiQGSVJJZdKzqQazx4vSN26gBgYO5yhTaE67OkZutnWgjNQvxS4aCzgZflG7KJSAqlW1_d8szMFH3h0cbjJXZdY7wAvXaO431=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/I8_eiQGSVJJZdKzqQazx4vSN26gBgYO5yhTaE67OkZutnWgjNQvxS4aCzgZflG7KJSAqlW1_d8szMFH3h0cbjJXZdY7wAvXaO431=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/I8_eiQGSVJJZdKzqQazx4vSN26gBgYO5yhTaE67OkZutnWgjNQvxS4aCzgZflG7KJSAqlW1_d8szMFH3h0cbjJXZdY7wAvXaO431=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" alt="Roche logo" width="1200" height="624" loading="lazy" /></picture>
                                </div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="QuoteSlide_body">
                                <figure class="QuoteSlide_figure">
                                  <blockquote class="blockquote--add-quotes">
                                    <p>We have 100,000 users and billions of files in Google Drive. We couldn’t handle the labeling process at scale without AI classification. It provides value immediately, from the moment you turn it on.</p>
                                  </blockquote>
                                  <figcaption class="QuoteSlide_figcaption"><strong>Tim Ehrhart</strong>, CISO, Roche</figcaption><span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/blog/customer-stories/roche-protects-files-ai-classification-google-drive" data-g-event="drive: customers #quote-carousel" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/blog/customer-stories/roche-protects-files-ai-classification-google-drive" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/blog/customer-stories/roche-protects-files-ai-classification-google-drive" data-uj-def="customers_quote_carousel" aria-label="Learn more about the Roche customer story" class="button button--medium"><span class="button__content">Learn more</span></a></span>
                                </figure>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div slot="slides">
                        <div class="QuoteSlide_container">
                          <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid QuoteSlide_grid">
                            <div style="--gws-column-desktop-start:2;--gws-column-desktop-end:11;" class="Grid_column QuoteSlide_gridCol">
                              <div class="QuoteSlide_logo">
                                <div class="LogoArea_container logo-area">
                                  <picture><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/O-L4YhRVWlzUuxX9PQo3aCdqfB3D7rxJXO5cVEhAyqU1_mmvbfxrxhlmVadFPTzRReCHAB-h8Xjeh0L_Ft4cgXFisA7a2n2nVD2f_g=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/O-L4YhRVWlzUuxX9PQo3aCdqfB3D7rxJXO5cVEhAyqU1_mmvbfxrxhlmVadFPTzRReCHAB-h8Xjeh0L_Ft4cgXFisA7a2n2nVD2f_g=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 1x, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/O-L4YhRVWlzUuxX9PQo3aCdqfB3D7rxJXO5cVEhAyqU1_mmvbfxrxhlmVadFPTzRReCHAB-h8Xjeh0L_Ft4cgXFisA7a2n2nVD2f_g=e365-pa-nu-s0-rw 2x" alt="MM Pakistan logo" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" /></picture>
                                </div>
                              </div>
                              <div class="QuoteSlide_body">
                                <figure class="QuoteSlide_figure">
                                  <blockquote class="blockquote--add-quotes">
                                    <p>Drive serves as a reference point for solutions from all our past projects so that our teams won’t feel like they need to reinvent the wheel when they start a new project.</p>
                                  </blockquote>
                                  <figcaption class="QuoteSlide_figcaption"><strong>Kamran Rafique</strong>, Technical Account Leader, MMP Pakistan</figcaption><span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/customers/mmp/ " data-g-event="drive: customers #quote-carousel" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/customers/mmp/" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/customers/mmp/ " data-uj-def="customers_quote_carousel" aria-label="Learn more about the MM Pakistan customer story" class="button button--medium"><span class="button__content">Learn more</span></a></span>
                                </figure>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </gws-carousel></div>
