        <div id="m34" data-module="TemplateSpacer" data-g-section-id="spacer">
          <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:92px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:120px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
        </div>
        <section id="faqs" data-module="TemplateSectionBreak" data-g-section-id="faqs">
          <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid TemplateSectionBreak_grid">
            <div style="--gws-column-laptop-start:4;--gws-column-laptop-end:9;" class="Grid_column TemplateSectionBreak_container">
              <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg TemplateSectionBreak_copyGroup">
                <h2 class="Heading_heading heading Heading_size:h3">Curious about Google Drive?</h2>
                <p>Take a look at our FAQs to learn more.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <div id="m36" data-module="TemplateSpacer" data-g-section-id="spacer">
          <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:36px;--gws-spacer-tablet-size:36px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:36px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
        </div>
        <section id="m37" data-module="TemplateFaq" data-g-section-id="faq">
          <div class="Container_layout">
            <div class="TemplateFaq_faq TemplateFaq_fullwidth">
              <div class="TemplateFaq_faq__content">
                <div class="TemplateFaq_faq__content__details"><gws-details-group module="faq">
                    <div slot="toggle"><gws-toggle-button states="[{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Expand all&quot;,&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;unfold_more&quot;},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Collapse all&quot;,&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;unfold_less&quot;}]" initial-state-index="0"><span class="gws-button"><button style="--material-icon: 'unfold_more';" aria-label="Expand all" data-g-event="products/drive: body" data-g-action="expand-all" data-g-label="in-page interaction" class="button button--low"><span class="button__content">Expand all</span></button></span></gws-toggle-button></div>
                    <div slot="title" class="TemplateFaq_faq__content__details__title"></div>
                    <li class="TemplateFaq_faq__content__details__card"><gws-details question="Can I migrate files from my current file storage solution to Drive?" heading-level="3" tracking-action="expand: Can I migrate files from my current file storage solution to Drive?" module="faq">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body">
                          <p>Yes, you can use our <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://support.google.com/a/answer/6003169?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-g-event="drive: body #faq" data-g-action="https://support.google.com/a/answer/6003169" data-g-label="https://support.google.com/a/answer/6003169?hl=en" data-uj-def="body_faq" aria-label="Open the migration tools and services page in a new tab" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">migration tools and services</span></a></span> to move your organization’s important data to Google Workspace from your current storage solutions.</p>
                        </div>
                      </gws-details></li>
                    <li class="TemplateFaq_faq__content__details__card"><gws-details question="How much storage do I get with Drive?" heading-level="3" tracking-action="expand: How much storage do I get with Drive?" module="faq">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body">
                          <p>Google Workspace’s Business and Enterprise editions provide customers with flexible options to meet their storage needs. To see which plan works best for your business, please visit our <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html?source=gafb-drive-body-en&amp;hl=en&amp;ga_region=amer&amp;ga_country=us&amp;ga_lang=en" data-g-event="drive: body #faq" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-uj-def="body_faq" aria-label="Open the plans and pricing page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">plans and pricing page</span></a></span>.</p>
                        </div>
                      </gws-details></li>
                    <li class="TemplateFaq_faq__content__details__card"><gws-details question="What's different about the business version of Drive?" heading-level="3" tracking-action="expand: What's different about the business version of Drive?" module="faq">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body">
                          <p>The business version of Drive gives you more storage, stronger support, and shared drives for your team. Learn more about the various options available on the <span class="gws-button"><a href="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html?source=gafb-drive-body-en&amp;hl=en&amp;ga_region=amer&amp;ga_country=us&amp;ga_lang=en" data-g-event="drive: body #faq" data-g-action="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-g-label="https://workspace.google.com/pricing.html" data-uj-def="body_faq" aria-label="Open the plans and pricing page" class="button button--inline"><span class="button__content">plans and pricing page</span></a></span>.</p>
                        </div>
                      </gws-details></li>
                  </gws-details-group></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <div id="m38" data-module="TemplateSpacer" data-g-section-id="spacer">
          <div style="--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:92px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:120px;" class="Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all"></div>
        </div>
        <section id="m39" data-module="TemplateDynamicModuleContainer" data-g-section-id="dynamic-module-container"><gws-dynamic-module-container data-module="TemplateDynamicModuleContainer">
            <div data-condition-type="HTTP referrer" data-match-value="workspace.preview.g6.goog|workspace.google.com|localhost" slot="condition" class="TemplateDynamicModuleContainer_conditionalModule">
              <section id="m1" data-module="TemplateTileSimple" data-g-section-id="tile-simple">
                <div class="TemplateTileSimple_container">
                  <div style="
    --gws-template-tile-simple-padding-tablet: 60px 0;
    --gws-template-tile-simple-padding-desktop: 80px 0;
    --gws-template-tile-simple-bg: #F8F9FA;
  " class="TemplateTileSimple_wrapper">
                    <div style="Grid_grid" class="Grid_grid TemplateTileSimple_grid">
                      <div style="--gws-column-tablet-start:1;--gws-column-tablet-end:12;--gws-column-laptop-start:1;--gws-column-laptop-end:12;" class="Grid_column">
                        <picture><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-workspace-assets/uploads/7uffzv9dk4sn-3AGHIcGci6RiNYtjf3Lfo2-4827a14a4409138cad096de1af549f60-drive_2026-192px.optimized.svg" alt="Drive icon" width="192" height="192" loading="lazy" class="TemplateTileSimple_image TemplateTileSimple_productLogoImageSizing" /></picture>
                      </div>
                      <div style="--gws-column-tablet-start:1;--gws-column-tablet-end:12;--gws-column-laptop-start:4;--gws-column-laptop-end:9;" class="Grid_column">
                        <div class="Text_container Text_body Text_lg TemplateTileSimple_body">
                          <h2 class="Heading_heading heading Heading_size:h2">Store, manage and collaborate with Google Drive</h2>
